       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ODO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE-LEN PIC 99 VALUE 5.
       01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-ENTRY OCCURS 1 TO 10 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-TABLE-LEN
               INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
               10 WS-VAL PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-TABLE-LEN
               MOVE WS-IDX TO WS-VAL(WS-IDX)
           END-PERFORM.

           DISPLAY WS-TABLE-LEN.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-TABLE-LEN
               DISPLAY WS-VAL(WS-IDX)
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
